<v anakin>Hold on. This whole operation was your idea.</v>

209
00:24:22.879 --> 00:24:25.996
<v obi-wan>Let us not forget, Anakin, that you rescued me from the buzz droids.</v>

210
00:24:26.091 --> 00:24:28.548
<v obi-wan>And you killed count dooku, and you rescued the chancellor,</v>

211
00:24:28.635 --> 00:24:30.546
<v obi-wan>carrying me unconscious on your back.</v>

212
00:24:30.637 --> 00:24:33.174
<v anakin>All because of your training.</v>

213
00:24:33.265 --> 00:24:36.803
<v obi-wan>Anakin, let's be fair. Today you were the hero,</v>

214
00:24:36.893 --> 00:24:39.976
<v obi-wan>and you deserve your glorious day with the politicians.</v>

215
00:24:40.063 --> 00:24:44.147
<v anakin>All right. But you owe me one, and not for saving your skin for the tenth time.</v>

216
00:24:44.234 --> 00:24:48.477
<v obi-wan>Ninth time. That business on cato neimoidia doesn't count.</v>

217
00:24:48.572 --> 00:24:50.483
<v obi-wan>I'll see you at the briefing.</v>

218
00:24:55.829 --> 00:24:58.366
<v mace-windu>Chancellor palpatine, are you all right?</v>

219
00:24:58.457 --> 00:25:01.369
<v palpatine>Yes. Thanks to your two jedi knights.</v>

220
00:25:01.460 --> 00:25:02.996
<v palpatine>They killed count dooku,</v>

221
00:25:03.086 --> 00:25:06.169
<v palpatine>but general grievous has escaped once again.</v>

222
00:25:06.256 --> 00:25:09.794
<v mace-windu>General grievous will run and hide, as he always does. He's a coward.</v>

223
00:25:09.885 --> 00:25:14.219
<v palpatine>But with count dooku dead, he is the leader of the droid army.</v>

224
00:25:14.306 --> 00:25:16.922
<v palpatine>And I assure you, the senate will vote</v>

225
00:25:17.017 --> 00:25:20.054
<v palpatine>to continue the war as long as grievous is alive.</v>

226
00:25:20.145 --> 00:25:24.229
<v mace-windu>Then the jedi council will make finding grievous our highest priority.</v>

227
00:25:25.650 --> 00:25:27.606
<v role-alien>Watch it.</v>
<v jar-jar>Excuse me.</v>

228
00:25:27.694 --> 00:25:28.979
Come along, r2.

229
00:25:29.071 --> 00:25:30.686
<v organa>The Republic cannot praise you enough.</v>

230
00:25:30.781 --> 00:25:32.897
<v anakin>Thank you, senator organa.</v>

231
00:25:34.076 --> 00:25:36.567
<v c-3po>Well, it couldn't possibly be as bad as all that.</v>

232
00:25:36.661 --> 00:25:38.617
<v c-3po>Now there I agree with you.</v>

233
00:25:38.705 --> 00:25:40.991
<v c-3po>In fact, I could do with a tune-up myself.</v>

234
00:25:42.167 --> 00:25:47.332
<v anakin>But the fighting will continue until general grievous is spare parts.</v>

235
00:25:47.422 --> 00:25:49.913
<v organa>Well, I will do everything I can in the senate.</v>

236
00:25:50.008 --> 00:25:52.294
<v anakin>Excuse me.</v>
<v organa>Certainly.</v>

237
00:26:02.896 --> 00:26:04.852
<v padme>Oh, Anakin.</v>

238
00:26:06.108 --> 00:26:09.600
<v anakin>I've missed you, Padmé.</v>

239
00:26:10.779 --> 00:26:14.021
<v padme>There were whispers that you'd been killed.</v>

240
00:26:14.116 --> 00:26:16.698
<v anakin>I'm all right.</v>

241
00:26:16.785 --> 00:26:19.777
<v anakin>It feels like we've been apart for a lifetime.</v>

242
00:26:19.871 --> 00:26:22.658
<v anakin>And it might have been, if the chancellor hadn't been kidnapped.</v>

243
00:26:22.791 --> 00:26:23.935
<v anakin>I don't think they would have</v>

244
00:26:23.959 --> 00:26:26.075
<v anakin>ever brought us back from the outer rim sieges.</v>

245
00:26:26.169 --> 00:26:28.911
<v padme>Wait. Not here.</v>
<v anakin>Yes, here.</v>

246
00:26:29.005 --> 00:26:32.497
<v anakin>I'm tired of all this deception. I don't care if they know we're married.</v>

247
00:26:32.592 --> 00:26:34.878
<v padme>Anakin, don't say things like that.</v>

248
00:26:43.687 --> 00:26:47.305
<v anakin>Are you all right? You're trembling.</v>

249
00:26:47.399 --> 00:26:49.560
<v anakin>What's going on?</v>

250
00:26:51.611 --> 00:26:53.852
<v padme>Something wonderful has happened.</v>

251
00:26:55.866 --> 00:26:59.074
<v padme>Ani, I'm pregnant.</v>

252
00:27:03.039 --> 00:27:04.950
<v anakin>That's...</v>

253
00:27:10.088 --> 00:27:12.670
<v anakin>(Stammering) Well, that's wonderful.</v>

254
00:27:14.384 --> 00:27:17.421
<v padme>What are we gonna do?</v>

255
00:27:18.889 --> 00:27:22.302
<v anakin>We're not gonna worry about anything right now. All right?</v>

256
00:27:22.392 --> 00:27:24.883
<v anakin>This is a happy moment.</v>

257
00:27:26.855 --> 00:27:29.187
<v anakin>The happiest moment of my life.</v>

258
00:28:35.006 --> 00:28:38.169
<v grievous>Yes, lord Sidious?</v>

259
00:28:38.260 --> 00:28:40.171
<v sidious>General grievous,</v>

260
00:28:40.262 --> 00:28:45.382
<v sidious>I suggest you move the separatist leaders to mustafar.</v>

261
00:28:45.475 --> 00:28:49.343
<v grievous>It will be done, my lord.</v>

262
00:28:49.437 --> 00:28:53.726
<v sidious>The end of the war is near, general.</v>

263
00:28:53.817 --> 00:28:57.435
<v grievous>But the loss of count dooku...</v>

264
00:28:57.529 --> 00:29:01.863
<v sidious>His death was a necessary loss.</v>

265
00:29:01.950 --> 00:29:06.114
<v sidious>Soon I will have a new apprentice,</v>

266
00:29:06.204 --> 00:29:11.494
<v sidious>one far younger and more powerful.</v>

267
00:29:38.486 --> 00:29:41.523
<v padme>Ani, I want to have our baby back home on Naboo.</v>

268
00:29:41.614 --> 00:29:44.981
<v padme>We can go to the lake country where no one will know,</v>

269
00:29:45.076 --> 00:29:46.987
<v padme>where we can be safe.</v>

270
00:29:48.204 --> 00:29:51.537
<v padme>I can go early and fix up the baby's room.</v>

271
00:29:53.543 --> 00:29:58.833
<v padme>I know the perfect spot. Right by the gardens.</v>

272
00:30:03.094 --> 00:30:06.427
<v anakin>You are so beautiful.</v>

273
00:30:08.016 --> 00:30:10.052
<v padme>It's only because I'm so in love.</v>

274
00:30:11.269 --> 00:30:12.600
<v anakin>No. (Chuckles)</v>

275
00:30:12.687 --> 00:30:15.895
<v anakin>No, it's because I'm so in love with you.</v>

276
00:30:15.982 --> 00:30:19.566
<v padme>So love has blinded you?</v>

277
00:30:21.321 --> 00:30:23.403
<v anakin>Well, that's not exactly what I meant.</v>

278
00:30:24.949 --> 00:30:27.031
<v padme>But it's probably true.</v>

279
00:30:34.584 --> 00:30:38.168
<v padme>(Groans) Anakin, help me!</v>

280
00:31:41.359 --> 00:31:43.315
<v padme>What's bothering you?</v>

281
00:31:45.697 --> 00:31:47.733
<v anakin>(Sighs) Nothing.</v>

282
00:31:49.617 --> 00:31:51.983
<v anakin>I remember when I gave this to you.</v>

283
00:31:52.078 --> 00:31:56.321
<v padme>How long is it gonna take for us to be honest with each other?</v>

284
00:31:58.877 --> 00:32:00.788
<v anakin>It was a dream.</v>

285
00:32:00.879 --> 00:32:03.040
<v padme>Bad?</v>

286
00:32:03.131 --> 00:32:05.588
<v anakin>Like the ones I used to have about my mother,</v>

287
00:32:05.675 --> 00:32:07.586
<v anakin>just before she died.</v>

288
00:32:07.677 --> 00:32:09.588
And?

289
00:32:12.432 --> 00:32:14.388
<v anakin>And it was about you.</v>

290
00:32:16.936 --> 00:32:18.892
<v padme>Tell me.</v>

291
00:32:20.607 --> 00:32:22.563
<v anakin>It was only a dream.</v>

292
00:32:35.497 --> 00:32:37.453
<v anakin>You die in childbirth.</v>

293
00:32:37.540 --> 00:32:40.327
<v padme>And the baby?</v>

294
00:32:40.418 --> 00:32:42.784
<v anakin>I don't know.</v>

295
00:32:44.255 --> 00:32:46.166
<v padme>It was only a dream.</v>

296
00:32:46.257 --> 00:32:49.090
<v anakin>I won't let this one become real.</v>

297
00:32:50.178 --> 00:32:52.840
<v padme>This baby will change our lives.</v>

298
00:32:52.931 --> 00:32:55.843
<v padme>I doubt the queen will continue to allow me to serve in the senate.</v>

299
00:32:55.934 --> 00:32:58.676
<v padme>And if the council discovers you're the father, you'll be expelled...</v>

300
00:32:58.770 --> 00:33:01.307
<v anakin>I know. I know.</v>

301
00:33:01.397 --> 00:33:05.106
<v padme>Do you think Obi-Wan might be able to help us?</v>

302
00:33:07.111 --> 00:33:09.147
<v anakin>We don't need his help.</v>

303
00:33:10.448 --> 00:33:13.485
<v anakin>Our baby is a blessing.</v>

304
00:33:29.676 --> 00:33:33.840
Pramonitions? Premonitions. Hmm.

305
00:33:33.930 --> 00:33:37.093
<v yoda>These visions you have...</v>

306
00:33:37.183 --> 00:33:40.801
<v anakin>They're of pain, suffering.</v>

307
00:33:42.730 --> 00:33:44.641
<v anakin>Death.</v>

308
00:33:44.732 --> 00:33:49.146
<v yoda>Yourself you speak of, or someone you know?</v>

309
00:33:50.613 --> 00:33:52.649
<v anakin>Someone.</v>

310
00:33:52.740 --> 00:33:54.651
<v yoda>Close to you?</v>

311
00:33:55.827 --> 00:33:58.068
<v anakin>Yes.</v>

312
00:33:58.162 --> 00:34:02.030
<v yoda>Careful you must be when sensing the future, Anakin.</v>

313
00:34:02.125 --> 00:34:06.459
<v yoda>The fear of loss is a path to the dark side.</v>

314
00:34:08.673 --> 00:34:11.961
<v anakin>I won't let these visions come true, master Yoda.</v>

315
00:34:12.051 --> 00:34:15.259
<v yoda>Death is a natural part of life.</v>

316
00:34:15.346 --> 00:34:20.056
<v yoda>Rejoice for those around you who transform into the force.</v>

317
00:34:20.143 --> 00:34:23.431
<v yoda>Mourn them, do not. Miss them, do not.</v>

318
00:34:23.521 --> 00:34:26.638
<v yoda>Attachment leads to jealousy.</v>

319
00:34:26.733 --> 00:34:30.191
<v yoda>The shadow of greed that is.</v>

320
00:34:30.278 --> 00:34:33.111
<v anakin>What must I do, master Yoda?</v>

321
00:34:33.197 --> 00:34:36.280
<v yoda>Train yourself to let go</v>

322
00:34:36.367 --> 00:34:39.825
<v yoda>of everything you fear to lose.</v>

323
00:34:50.214 --> 00:34:52.956
<v obi-wan>You've missed the report on the outer rim sieges.</v>

324
00:34:54.385 --> 00:34:56.797
<v anakin>I'm sorry. I was held up.</v>

325
00:34:56.888 --> 00:35:00.472
I have no excuse. In short, they are going very well.

326
00:35:00.558 --> 00:35:05.973
<v obi-wan>Saleucami has fallen, and master vos has moved his troops to boz pity.</v>

327
00:35:06.064 --> 00:35:08.100
<v anakin>What's wrong, then? J</v>

328
00:35:09.692 --> 00:35:10.807
<v obi-wan>the senate is expected</v>

329
00:35:10.902 --> 00:35:14.394
<v obi-wan>to vote more executive powers to the chancellor today.</v>

330
00:35:14.489 --> 00:35:17.526
<v anakin>Well, that can only mean less deliberating and more action.</v>

331
00:35:17.617 --> 00:35:18.857
<v anakin>Ils that bad?</v>

332
00:35:18.951 --> 00:35:21.408
<v anakin>It'll make it easier for us to end this war.</v>

333
00:35:23.122 --> 00:35:25.454
<v obi-wan>Be careful of your friend palpatine.</v>

334
00:35:27.085 --> 00:35:28.996
<v anakin>Be careful of what?</v>

335
00:35:29.087 --> 00:35:31.749
He has requested your presence. What for?

336
00:35:31.839 --> 00:35:36.503
He would not say. He didn't inform the council?

337
00:35:36.594 --> 00:35:40.052
That's unusual, isn't it? All of this is unusual.

338
00:35:40.139 --> 00:35:42.596
<v obi-wan>And it's making me feel uneasy.</v>

339
00:35:57.573 --> 00:35:59.484
<v palpatine>I hope you trust me, Anakin.</v>

340
00:36:00.743 --> 00:36:01.743
<v anakin>Of course.</v>

341
00:36:02.870 --> 00:36:04.781
<v palpatine>I need your help, son.</v>

342
00:36:05.915 --> 00:36:07.951
<v anakin>What do you mean?</v>

343
00:36:08.042 --> 00:36:11.250
<v palpatine>I'm depending on you.</v>

344
00:36:11.337 --> 00:36:13.248
<v anakin>For what? I don't understand.</v>

345
00:36:13.339 --> 00:36:18.925
<v palpatine>To be the eyes, ears and voice of the Republic.</v>

346
00:36:19.011 --> 00:36:21.172
<v palpatine>Anakin,</v>

347
00:36:21.264 --> 00:36:25.428
<v palpatine>I'm appointing you to be my personal representative on the jedi council.</v>

348
00:36:30.398 --> 00:36:32.309
<v anakin>I'm overwhelmed, sir.</v>

349
00:36:34.193 --> 00:36:37.310
<v anakin>But the council elects its own members. They'll never accept this.</v>

350
00:36:37.405 --> 00:36:40.897
<v palpatine>I think they will. They need you.</v>

351
00:36:40.992 --> 00:36:43.449
<v palpatine>More than you know.</v>

352
00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:58.920
<v yoda>Allow this appointment lightly the council does not.</v>

353
00:36:59.010 --> 00:37:02.468
<v yoda>Disturbing is this move by chancellor palpatine.</v>

354
00:37:03.639 --> 00:37:05.220
<v anakin>I understand.</v>

355
00:37:05.308 --> 00:37:10.393
<v mace-windu>You are on this council, but we do not Grant you the rank of master.</v>

356
00:37:11.314 --> 00:37:12.520
<v anakin>What?</v>

357
00:37:17.320 --> 00:37:20.983
<v anakin>How can you do this? This is outrageous.</v>

358
00:37:21.741 --> 00:37:23.231
<v anakin>It's unfair.</v>

359
00:37:24.619 --> 00:37:27.861
<v anakin>How can you be on the council and not be a master?</v>

360
00:37:27.955 --> 00:37:31.493
<v mace-windu>Take a seat, young Skywalker.</v>

361
00:37:34.545 --> 00:37:36.831
<v anakin>Forgive me, master.</v>

362
00:37:39.884 --> 00:37:42.842
<v ki-adi-mundi>We have surveyed all systems in the Republic,</v>

363
00:37:42.929 --> 00:37:46.672
<v ki-adi-mundi>but have found no sign of general grievous.</v>

364
00:37:46.766 --> 00:37:49.553
<v yoda>Hiding in the outer rim grievous is.</v>

365
00:37:49.644 --> 00:37:52.761
<v yoda>The outlying systems you must sweep.</v>

366
00:37:52.855 --> 00:37:55.096
<v obi-wan>We do not have many ships to spare.</v>

367
00:37:55.191 --> 00:37:57.398
<v ki-adi-mundi>What about the droid aflack on the wookiees?</v>

368
00:37:57.485 --> 00:38:01.194
<v mace-windu>It is critical we send an attack group there immediately.</v>

369
00:38:01.280 --> 00:38:04.738
<v obi-wan>He's right. It's a system we cannot afford to lose.</v>

370
00:38:06.035 --> 00:38:08.151
<v yoda>Go I will.</v>

371
00:38:08.246 --> 00:38:11.283
<v yoda>Good relations with the wookiees I have.</v>

372
00:38:11.374 --> 00:38:15.708
<v mace-windu>It's settled then. Yoda will take a battalion of clones</v>

373
00:38:15.795 --> 00:38:18.127
<v mace-windu>to reinforce the wookiees on kashyyyk. Ywy</v>

374
00:38:18.214 --> 00:38:20.296
<v mace-windu>may the force be with us all.</v>

375
00:38:22.510 --> 00:38:25.172
<v anakin>What kind of nonsense is this?</v>

376
00:38:25.263 --> 00:38:27.675
<v anakin>Put me on the council and not make me a master?</v>

377
00:38:27.765 --> 00:38:30.507
<v anakin>It's never been done in the history of the jedi. It's insulting.</v>

378
00:38:30.601 --> 00:38:33.513
<v obi-wan>Oh, calm down, Anakin. You have been given a great honor.</v>

379
00:38:33.604 --> 00:38:37.643
<v obi-wan>To be on the council at your age, it's never happened before.</v>

380
00:38:37.733 --> 00:38:41.146
<v obi-wan>The fact of the matter is you are too close to the chancellor.</v>

381
00:38:41.237 --> 00:38:45.025
<v obi-wan>The council doesn't like it when he interferes in jedi affairs.</v>

382
00:38:45.116 --> 00:38:48.574
<v anakin>I swear to you, I didn't ask to be put on the council.</v>

383
00:38:48.661 --> 00:38:50.868
<v obi-wan>But it's what you wanted.</v>

384
00:38:50.955 --> 00:38:54.288
<v obi-wan>Your friendship with chancellor palpatine seems to have paid off.</v>

385
00:38:54.375 --> 00:38:56.286
<v anakin>That has nothing to do with this.</v>

386
00:38:56.377 --> 00:38:59.335
<v obi-wan>The only reason the council has approved your appointment</v>

387
00:38:59.422 --> 00:39:02.414
<v obi-wan>is because the chancellor trusts you.</v>

388
00:39:02.508 --> 00:39:05.545
<v anakin>And?</v>
<v obi-wan>Anakin, I am on your side.</v>

389
00:39:05.636 --> 00:39:07.592
<v obi-wan>I didn't want to put you in this situation.</v>

390
00:39:07.680 --> 00:39:08.965
<v anakin>What situation?</v>

391
00:39:13.019 --> 00:39:17.388
<v obi-wan>The council wants you to report on all the chancellor's dealings.</v>

392
00:39:17.481 --> 00:39:19.847
<v obi-wan>They want to know what he's up to.</v>

393
00:39:24.363 --> 00:39:27.230
<v anakin>They want me to spy on the chancellor?</v>

394
00:39:27.325 --> 00:39:28.485
<v anakin>But that's treason.</v>

395
00:39:28.576 --> 00:39:29.986
<v obi-wan>We are at war, Anakin.</v>

396
00:39:31.996 --> 00:39:34.954
<v anakin>Why didn't the council give me this assignment when we were in session?</v>

397
00:39:35.041 --> 00:39:37.498
<v obi-wan>This assignment is not to be on record.</v>

398
00:39:37.585 --> 00:39:41.544
<v anakin>The chancellor is not a bad man, Obi-Wan.</v>

399
00:39:41.631 --> 00:39:44.668
<v anakin>He befriended me. He's watched out for me ever since I arrived here.</v>

400
00:39:44.759 --> 00:39:46.875
<v obi-wan>That is why you must help us.</v>

401
00:39:46.969 --> 00:39:50.461
<v obi-wan>Anakin, our allegiance is to the senate, not to its leader,</v>

402
00:39:50.556 --> 00:39:54.265
<v obi-wan>who has managed to stay in office long after his term has expired.</v>

403
00:39:54.352 --> 00:39:56.343
<v anakin>The senate demanded that he stay longer.</v>

404
00:39:56.437 --> 00:39:59.600
<v obi-wan>Yes, but use your feelings, Anakin. Something is out of place.</v>

405
00:39:59.690 --> 00:40:04.275
<v anakin>(Sighs) You're asking me to do something against the jedi code,</v>

406
00:40:04.362 --> 00:40:08.105
<v anakin>against the Republic, against a mentor and a friend.</v>

407
00:40:08.199 --> 00:40:12.033
<v anakin>That's what's out of place here. Why are you asking this of me?</v>

408
00:40:14.330 --> 00:40:16.241
<v obi-wan>The council is asking you.</v>

409
00:40:23.172 --> 00:40:27.962
<v obi-wan>Anakin did not take to his new assignment with much enthusiasm.</v>

410
00:40:28.052 --> 00:40:31.260
<v mace-windu>It's very dangerous, putting them together.</v>

411
00:40:31.347 --> 00:40:33.679
<v mace-windu>I don't think the boy can handle it.</v>

412
00:40:33.766 --> 00:40:36.303
I don't trust him.

413
00:40:36.394 --> 00:40:40.262
<v obi-wan>With all due respect, master, is he not the chosen one?</v>

414
00:40:40.356 --> 00:40:44.065
<v obi-wan>Is he not to destroy the sith and bring balance to the force?</v>

415
00:40:44.151 --> 00:40:47.018
<v mace-windu>So the prophecy says.</v>

416
00:40:47.113 --> 00:40:52.028
<v yoda>A prophecy that misread could have been.</v>

417
00:40:53.828 --> 00:40:55.739
<v obi-wan>He will not let me down.</v>

418
00:40:55.830 --> 00:40:57.786
<v obi-wan>He never has.</v>

419
00:40:57.873 --> 00:41:00.910
<v yoda>I hope right you are.</v>

420
00:41:24.233 --> 00:41:29.603
<v anakin>(Sighs) Sometimes I wonder what's happening to the jedi order.</v>

421
00:41:29.697 --> 00:41:32.780
<v anakin>I think this war is destroying the principles of the Republic.</v>

422
00:41:34.618 --> 00:41:37.826
<v padme>Have you ever considered that we may be on the wrong side?</v>

423
00:41:37.913 --> 00:41:40.404
<v anakin>What do you mean?</v>

424
00:41:40.499 --> 00:41:45.118
<v padme>What if the democracy we thought we were serving no longer exists,</v>

425
00:41:45.212 --> 00:41:48.830
<v padme>and the Republic has become the very evil we've been fighting to destroy?</v>

426
00:41:48.924 --> 00:41:50.960
<v anakin>I don't believe that.</v>

427
00:41:51.052 --> 00:41:53.168
<v anakin>And you're sounding like a separatist.</v>

428
00:41:55.139 --> 00:41:58.097
<v padme>This war represents a failure to listen.</v>

429
00:41:58.184 --> 00:42:00.220
<v padme>Now you're closer to the chancellor than anyone.</v>

430
00:42:00.311 --> 00:42:03.599
<v padme>Please, ask him to stop the fighting and let diplomacy resume.</v>

431
00:42:03.689 --> 00:42:06.271
<v anakin>Don't ask me to do that.</v>

432
00:42:07.818 --> 00:42:11.481
<v anakin>Make a motion in the senate, where that kind of a request belongs.</v>

433
00:42:11.572 --> 00:42:14.405
<v padme>What is it?</v>
<v anakin>Nothing.</v>

434
00:42:15.701 --> 00:42:19.569
<v padme>Don't do this. Don't shut me out. Let me help you.</v>

435
00:42:21.624 --> 00:42:23.990
<v padme>Hold me.</v>

436
00:42:24.085 --> 00:42:27.248
<v padme>Like you did by the lake on Naboo.</v>

437
00:42:27.338 --> 00:42:31.126
<v padme>So long ago, when there was nothing but our love.</v>

438
00:42:31.217 --> 00:42:34.675
<v padme>No politics, no plotting, no war.</v>

439
00:43:13.884 --> 00:43:17.251
<v anakin>You wanted to see me, chancellor.</v>
<v palpatine>Yes, Anakin. Come closer.</v>

440
00:43:17.346 --> 00:43:19.962
<v palpatine>I have good news.</v>

441
00:43:20.057 --> 00:43:22.343
<v palpatine>Our clone intelligence units</v>

442
00:43:22.434 --> 00:43:25.426
<v palpatine>have discovered the location of general grievous.</v>

443
00:43:25.521 --> 00:43:27.432
<v palpatine>He's hiding in the utapau system. J k y</v>

444
00:43:27.523 --> 00:43:29.434
<v anakin>at last.</v>

445
00:43:30.818 --> 00:43:34.026
<v anakin>We'll be able to capture that monster and end this war.</v>

446
00:43:34.113 --> 00:43:37.480
<v palpatine>I would worry about the collective wisdom of the council</v>

447
00:43:37.575 --> 00:43:39.987
<v palpatine>if it didn't select you for this assignment.</v>

448
00:43:40.077 --> 00:43:43.444
<v palpatine>You're the best choice, by far.</v>

449
00:43:44.874 --> 00:43:47.866
<v palpatine>Hmm. Sit down.</v>

450
00:43:47.960 --> 00:43:49.871
<v palpatine>Leave us.</v>

451
00:44:01.849 --> 00:44:03.760
<v palpatine>Anakin,</v>

452
00:44:03.851 --> 00:44:08.311
<v palpatine>you know I'm not able to rely on the jedi council,</v>

453
00:44:10.065 --> 00:44:14.274
<v palpatine>if they haven't included you in their plot, they soon will.</v>

454
00:44:14.361 --> 00:44:16.477
<v anakin>I'm not sure I understand.</v>

455
00:44:16.572 --> 00:44:20.281
<v palpatine>You must sense what I have come to suspect.</v>

456
00:44:20.367 --> 00:44:23.780
<v palpatine>The jedi council want control of the Republic.</v>

457
00:44:25.122 --> 00:44:27.659
<v palpatine>They're planning to betray me.</v>

458
00:44:27.750 --> 00:44:30.162
I don't think that... Anakin.

459
00:44:31.337 --> 00:44:33.293
<v palpatine>Search your feelings.</v>

460
00:44:35.466 --> 00:44:38.048
<v palpatine>You know, don't you?</v>

461
00:44:42.431 --> 00:44:45.548
I know they don't trust you. Hmm. Or the senate.

462
00:44:45.643 --> 00:44:50.478
<v palpatine>Or the Republic, or democracy, for that matter.</v>

463
00:44:50.564 --> 00:44:55.604
<v anakin>I have to admit, my trust in them has been shaken.</v>

464
00:44:59.240 --> 00:45:01.276
<v palpatine>They asked you to do something</v>

465
00:45:01.367 --> 00:45:03.653
<v palpatine>that made you feel dishonest, didn't they?</v>

466
00:45:06.664 --> 00:45:09.531
<v palpatine>They asked you to spy on me, didn't they?</v>

467
00:45:14.088 --> 00:45:16.579
<v anakin>I don't, uh...</v>

468
00:45:16.674 --> 00:45:18.585
<v anakin>I don't know what to say.</v>

469
00:45:18.676 --> 00:45:22.260
<v palpatine>Remember back to your early teachings.</v>

470
00:45:22.346 --> 00:45:26.680
<v palpatine>All who gain power are afraid to lose it.</v>

471
00:45:26.767 --> 00:45:28.632
<v palpatine>Even the jedi.</v>

472
00:45:28.727 --> 00:45:31.434
<v anakin>The jedi use their power for good.</v>

473
00:45:31.522 --> 00:45:33.683
<v palpatine>Good is a point of view, Anakin.</v>

474
00:45:33.774 --> 00:45:38.985
<v palpatine>The sith and the jedi are similar in almost every way,</v>

475
00:45:40.990 --> 00:45:43.777
<v palpatine>including their quest for greater power.</v>

476
00:45:45.286 --> 00:45:48.323
<v anakin>The sith rely on their passion for their strength.</v>

477
00:45:48.414 --> 00:45:51.201
<v anakin>They think inwards, only about themselves.</v>

478
00:45:52.376 --> 00:45:54.617
<v palpatine>And the jedi don't?</v>

479
00:45:54.712 --> 00:45:59.297
<v anakin>The jedi are selfless. They only care about others.</v>

480
00:46:09.476 --> 00:46:14.470
<v palpatine>Did you ever hear the tragedy of darth plagueis the wise?</v>

481
00:46:18.694 --> 00:46:21.151
<v anakin>No.</v>
<v palpatine>I thought not.</v>

482
00:46:21.238 --> 00:46:23.650
<v palpatine>It's not a story the jedi would tell you.</v>

483
00:46:25.075 --> 00:46:27.441
<v palpatine>It's a sith legend.</v>

484
00:46:27.536 --> 00:46:29.447
<v palpatine>Darth plagueis</v>

485
00:46:29.538 --> 00:46:35.204
<v palpatine>was a dark lord of the sith so powerful and so wise,</v>

486
00:46:35.294 --> 00:46:40.163
<v palpatine>he could use the force to influence the midi-chlorians</v>

487
00:46:40.257 --> 00:46:43.465
<v palpatine>to create life.</v>

488
00:46:45.095 --> 00:46:48.178
<v palpatine>He had such a knowledge of the dark side,</v>

489
00:46:48.265 --> 00:46:53.305
<v palpatine>he could even keep the ones he cared about</v>

490
00:46:53.395 --> 00:46:55.306
<v palpatine>from dying.</v>

491
00:46:59.610 --> 00:47:03.444
<v anakin>He could actually save people from death?</v>

492
00:47:03.530 --> 00:47:08.820
<v palpatine>The dark side of the force is a pathway to many abilities</v>

493
00:47:08.911 --> 00:47:13.154
<v palpatine>some consider to be unnatural.</v>

494
00:47:14.249 --> 00:47:16.114
<v anakin>What happened to him?</v>

495
00:47:16.210 --> 00:47:19.293
<v palpatine>He became so powerful,</v>

496
00:47:20.547 --> 00:47:23.539
<v palpatine>the only thing he was afraid of was</v>

497
00:47:23.634 --> 00:47:25.545
<v palpatine>losing his power.</v>

498
00:47:25.636 --> 00:47:29.094
<v palpatine>Which eventually, of course, he did.</v>

499
00:47:29.181 --> 00:47:35.051
<v palpatine>Unfortunately, he taught his apprentice everything he knew.</v>

500
00:47:35.145 --> 00:47:38.854
<v palpatine>Then his apprentice killed him in his sleep.</v>

501
00:47:40.984 --> 00:47:42.895
<v palpatine>It's ironic.</v>

502
00:47:42.986 --> 00:47:45.022
<v palpatine>He could save others from death,</v>

503
00:47:46.115 --> 00:47:48.231
<v palpatine>but not himself.</v>

504
00:47:52.371 --> 00:47:54.953
<v anakin>Is it possible to learn this power?</v>

505
00:47:58.752 --> 00:48:00.913
<v palpatine>Not from a jedi.</v>

506
00:48:17.771 --> 00:48:21.184
<v role-man>All red units, over here! Let's go. Let's go. Move!</v>

507
00:48:30.784 --> 00:48:34.572
<v ki-adi-mundi>Palpatine thinks general grievous is on utapau?</v>

508
00:48:34.663 --> 00:48:37.746
<v anakin>A partial message was intercepted in a diplomatic packet</v>

509
00:48:37.833 --> 00:48:40.950
<v anakin>from the chairman of utapau. Hmm.</v>

510
00:48:41.044 --> 00:48:43.786
<v yoda>Act on this we must</v>

511
00:48:43.881 --> 00:48:48.625
<v yoda>the capture of general grievous will end this war:</v>

512
00:48:48.719 --> 00:48:52.587
<v yoda>Quickly and decisively we should proceed.</v>

513
00:48:52.681 --> 00:48:57.721
<v anakin>The chancellor has requested that I lead the campaign.</v>

514
00:48:57.811 --> 00:49:01.144
<v mace-windu>The council will make up its own mind who is to go,</v>

515
00:49:01.231 --> 00:49:03.222
<v mace-windu>not the chancellor.</v>

516
00:49:03.317 --> 00:49:08.277
<v yoda>A master is needed, with more experience.</v>

517
00:49:08.363 --> 00:49:12.857
<v ki-adi-mundi>I concur. Master Kenobi should go.</v>

518
00:49:12.951 --> 00:49:15.317
<v yoda>I agree. Ki-adi-mundi: Aye.</v>

519
00:49:15.412 --> 00:49:17.323
<v mace-windu>Aye.</v>

520
00:49:17.414 --> 00:49:21.157
<v mace-windu>Very well. Council adjourned.</v>

521
00:49:27.925 --> 00:49:30.028
<v gree>The droids have started up their main power generators.</v>

522
00:49:30.052 --> 00:49:34.136
<v yoda>Then now the time is, commander.</v>

523
00:49:34.223 --> 00:49:35.554
<v gree>Yes, sir.</v>

524
00:50:04.628 --> 00:50:06.584
<v role-man>Head for cover!</v>

525
00:50:22.145 --> 00:50:23.885
<v anakin>You're gonna need me on this one, master.</v>

526
00:50:23.981 --> 00:50:25.061
<v obi-wan>Oh, I agree.</v>

527
00:50:25.148 --> 00:50:28.185
<v obi-wan>However, it may turn out just to be a wild bantha chase.</v>

528
00:50:28.277 --> 00:50:29.277
<v anakin>Master.</v>

529
00:50:31.321 --> 00:50:32.811
<v anakin>I've disappointed you.</v>

530
00:50:32.906 --> 00:50:36.524
<v anakin>Uh, I haven't been very appreciative of your training.</v>

531
00:50:36.618 --> 00:50:41.032
<v anakin>I've been arrogant, and I apologize.</v>

532
00:50:41.123 --> 00:50:43.489
<v anakin>I've just been so frustrated with the council.</v>

533
00:50:46.795 --> 00:50:50.538
<v obi-wan>You are strong and wise, Anakin, and I am very proud of you.</v>

534
00:50:50.632 --> 00:50:53.248
<v obi-wan>I have trained you since you were a small boy.</v>

535
00:50:53.343 --> 00:50:55.459
<v obi-wan>I have taught you everything I know.</v>

536
00:50:55.554 --> 00:50:59.297
<v obi-wan>And you have become a far greater jedi than I could ever hope to be.</v>

537
00:51:00.309 --> 00:51:02.095
<v obi-wan>But be patient, Anakin.</v>

538
00:51:02.185 --> 00:51:06.178
<v obi-wan>It will not be long before the council makes you a jedi master.</v>

539
00:51:13.530 --> 00:51:16.818
<v anakin>Obi-Wan. May the force be with you.</v>

540
00:51:16.908 --> 00:51:19.820
<v obi-wan>Goodbye, old friend. May the force be with you.</v>

541
00:51:42.392 --> 00:51:44.508
<v cody>Fortunately, most of the cities</v>

542
00:51:44.603 --> 00:51:46.969
<v cody>are concentrated on this small continent here.</v>

543
00:51:47.064 --> 00:51:48.645
<v cody>On the far side.</v>

544
00:51:48.732 --> 00:51:51.144
<v obi-wan>I'll keep them distracted until you get there.</v>

545
00:51:51.234 --> 00:51:52.895
<v obi-wan>Just don't take too long.</v>

546
00:51:52.986 --> 00:51:54.647
<v cody>Come on. When have I ever let you down?</v>

547
00:51:54.738 --> 00:51:56.649
<v obi-wan>(Chuckles) Very well.</v>

548
00:51:56.740 --> 00:52:01.234
<v obi-wan>The burden is on me not to destroy all the droids until you arrive.</v>

549
00:52:26.853 --> 00:52:28.764
<v obi-wan>Save your energy.</v>

550
00:52:28.855 --> 00:52:30.891
<v padme>(Sighs) I can't.</v>

551
00:52:30.982 --> 00:52:32.768
<v obi-wan>Don't give up, padme.</v>

552
00:52:46.248 --> 00:52:48.705
<v anakin>Obi-Wan's been here, hasn't he?</v>

553
00:52:48.792 --> 00:52:50.874
<v padme>He came by this morning.</v>

554
00:52:52.254 --> 00:52:54.165
<v anakin>What did he want?</v>

555
00:52:54.256 --> 00:52:56.212
<v padme>He's worried about you.</v>

556
00:52:58.677 --> 00:53:01.134
<v padme>He says you've been under a lot of stress.</v>

557
00:53:04.224 --> 00:53:05.509
<v anakin>I feel lost.</v>

558
00:53:06.643 --> 00:53:09.806
<v padme>Lost? What do you mean?</v>

559
00:53:11.690 --> 00:53:14.056
<v anakin>Obi-Wan and the council don't trust me.</v>

560
00:53:14.151 --> 00:53:17.609
<v padme>They trust you with their lives.</v>

561
00:53:19.322 --> 00:53:21.404
<v anakin>Something's happening.</v>

562
00:53:21.491 --> 00:53:24.153
<v anakin>I'm not the jedi I should be.</v>

563
00:53:26.496 --> 00:53:28.452
<v anakin>I want more.</v>

564
00:53:29.666 --> 00:53:31.577
<v anakin>And I know I shouldn't.</v>

565
00:53:33.670 --> 00:53:35.661
<v padme>You expect too much of yourself.</v>

566
00:53:39.634 --> 00:53:42.842
I found a way to save you. Save me?

567
00:53:42.929 --> 00:53:44.885
<v anakin>From my nightmares.</v>

568
00:53:44.973 --> 00:53:46.929
<v padme>Is that what's bothering you?</v>

569
00:53:47.934 --> 00:53:50.596
<v anakin>I won't lose you, padme.</v>

570
00:53:50.687 --> 00:53:52.803
<v padme>I'm not gonna die in childbirth, ani.</v>

571
00:53:52.898 --> 00:53:55.355
<v padme>I promise you.</v>
<v anakin>No, I promise you.</v>

572
00:54:39.277 --> 00:54:41.689
<v tion-medon>Greetings, young jedi.</v>

573
00:54:41.780 --> 00:54:45.238
<v tion-medon>What brings you to our remote sanctuary?</v>

574
00:54:45.325 --> 00:54:47.281
<v obi-wan>Unfortunately, the war.</v>

575
00:54:47.369 --> 00:54:51.954
<v tion-medon>There's no war here unless you brought it with you.</v>

576
00:54:52.040 --> 00:54:55.248
<v obi-wan>With your kind permission, I should like some fuel</v>

577
00:54:55.335 --> 00:54:57.041
<v obi-wan>and to use your city as a base</v>

578
00:54:57.128 --> 00:55:01.167
<v obi-wan>as I search nearby systems for general grievous.</v>

579
00:55:09.266 --> 00:55:12.554
<v tion-medon>He is here. We are being held hostage.</v>

580
00:55:12.644 --> 00:55:15.556
They are watching us. =I understand.

581
00:55:15.647 --> 00:55:20.482
<v tion-medon>Tenth level, thousands of battle droids.</v>

582
00:55:20.569 --> 00:55:23.026
<v obi-wan>Tell your people to take shelter.</v>

583
00:55:23.113 --> 00:55:26.105
<v obi-wan>If you have warriors, now is the time.</v>

584
00:55:37.002 --> 00:55:41.211
<v obi-wan>Take the fighter back to the ship. Tell Cody I've made contact,</v>

585
00:55:43.174 --> 00:55:47.292
is he bringing additional warriors?
<v tion-medon>He didn't say.</v>

586
00:56:29.596 --> 00:56:34.841
<v grievous>It won't be long before the armies of the Republic track us here.</v>

587
00:56:37.437 --> 00:56:42.682
<v grievous>I am sending you to the mustafar system in the outer rim.</v>

588
00:56:50.158 --> 00:56:52.490
<v grievous>It is a volcanic planet.</v>

589
00:56:52.577 --> 00:56:55.910
<v grievous>You will be safe there.</v>
<v gunray>Safe?</v>

590
00:56:55.997 --> 00:56:59.990
<v gunray>Hmph! Chancellor palpatine managed to escape your grip, general.</v>

591
00:57:00.085 --> 00:57:04.545
<v gunray>Without count dooku, I have doubts about your ability to keep us safe.</v>

592
00:57:04.631 --> 00:57:07.589
<v grievous>Be thankful, viceroy,</v>

593
00:57:07.676 --> 00:57:10.588
<v grievous>you have not found yourself in my grip.</v>

594
00:57:14.057 --> 00:57:17.549
<v grievous>Your ship is waiting.</v>

595
00:57:34.869 --> 00:57:35.869
<v obi-wan>Hello there.</v>

596
00:57:37.789 --> 00:57:43.079
<v grievous>General Kenobi. (Cackles)</v>

597
00:57:43.169 --> 00:57:45.706
<v grievous>You are a bold one.</v>

598
00:57:45.797 --> 00:57:49.255
<v grievous>(Cackles) Kill him.</v>

599
00:58:05.066 --> 00:58:07.182
<v grievous>Back away.</v>

600
00:58:07.277 --> 00:58:11.236
<v grievous>I will deal with this jedi slime myself.</v>

601
00:58:11.322 --> 00:58:13.529
<v obi-wan>Your move.</v>

602
00:58:13.616 --> 00:58:15.527
<v grievous>You fool.</v>

603
00:58:15.618 --> 00:58:21.284
<v grievous>I've been trained in your jedi arts by count dooku.</v>

604
00:58:27.797 --> 00:58:30.288
<v grievous>Attack, Kenobi.</v>

605
00:59:27.982 --> 00:59:30.002
\. \ nl 4: > 4 man 1: Go, go, go, go! Move it! Move it!

606
00:59:30.026 --> 00:59:32.017
Everybody out. Let's go, let's go, let's go.

607
00:59:32.112 --> 00:59:34.023
<v role-man>Cover yourself. Come on.</v>

608
00:59:39.160 --> 00:59:42.152
<v role-man>Move it! Move itl</v>

609
00:59:43.832 --> 00:59:45.538
<v role-man>Come on, move! Come on, everybody!</v>

610
00:59:46.626 --> 00:59:48.958
<v grievous>Army or not,</v>

611
00:59:49.045 --> 00:59:54.165
<v grievous>you must realize you are doomed.</v>

612
00:59:54.259 --> 00:59:56.250
<v obi-wan>Oh, I don't think so. (Grunts)</v>

613
01:00:25.248 --> 01:00:27.955
(Whistles) Uh-oh.

614
01:00:33.089 --> 01:00:35.080
Hyah!

615
01:00:53.776 --> 01:00:56.017
(Screams) Man: Cover that corner.

616
01:01:02.452 --> 01:01:04.534
<v cody>Master windu, may I interrupt?</v>

617
01:01:04.621 --> 01:01:07.408
<v cody>General Kenobi has made contact with general grievous,</v>

618
01:01:07.498 --> 01:01:09.784
<v cody>and we have begun our attack.</v>

619
01:01:09.876 --> 01:01:12.288
<v mace-windu>Thank you, commander.</v>

620
01:01:12.378 --> 01:01:15.541
<v mace-windu>Anakin, deliver this report to the chancellor.</v>

621
01:01:15.632 --> 01:01:18.214
<v mace-windu>His reaction will give us a clue to his intentions.</v>

622
01:01:18.301 --> 01:01:20.462
<v anakin>Yes, master.</v>

623
01:01:27.227 --> 01:01:30.515
<v mace-windu>I sense a plot to destroy the jedi.</v>

624
01:01:30.605 --> 01:01:33.221
<v mace-windu>The dark side of the force surrounds the chancellor.</v>

625
01:01:33.316 --> 01:01:36.023
<v ki-adi-mundi>If he does not give up his emergency powers</v>

626
01:01:36.110 --> 01:01:37.691
<v ki-adi-mundi>after the destruction of grievous,</v>

627
01:01:37.779 --> 01:01:40.361
<v ki-adi-mundi>then he should be removed from office.</v>

628
01:01:40.448 --> 01:01:44.111
<v mace-windu>The jedi council would have to take control of the senate</v>

629
01:01:44.202 --> 01:01:46.363
<v mace-windu>in order to secure a peaceful transition.</v>

630
01:01:46.454 --> 01:01:50.914
<v yoda>To a dark place this line of thought will carry us.</v>

631
01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:56.666
<v yoda>Hmm. Great care we must take.</v>

632
01:02:02.720 --> 01:02:04.881
<v anakin>Chancellor:</v>

633
01:02:04.973 --> 01:02:07.510
<v anakin>We've just received a report from master Kenobi.</v>

634
01:02:07.600 --> 01:02:10.262
<v anakin>He has engaged general grievous.</v>

635
01:02:10.353 --> 01:02:13.720
<v palpatine>We can only hope that master Kenobi is up to the challenge.</v>

636
01:02:15.566 --> 01:02:17.557
<v anakin>I should be there with him.</v>

637
01:02:17.652 --> 01:02:20.018
<v palpatine>It's upsetting to me to see that the council</v>

638
01:02:20.113 --> 01:02:23.401
<v palpatine>doesn't seem to fully appreciate your talents.</v>

639
01:02:23.491 --> 01:02:27.609
<v palpatine>Don't you wonder why they won't make you a jedi master?</v>

640
01:02:29.289 --> 01:02:31.280
<v anakin>I wish I knew.</v>

641
01:02:32.583 --> 01:02:35.120
<v anakin>More and more I get the feeling that</v>

642
01:02:35.211 --> 01:02:37.452
<v anakin>I'm being excluded from the council.</v>

643
01:02:44.429 --> 01:02:48.388
<v anakin>I know there are things about the force that they're not telling me.</v>

644
01:02:50.601 --> 01:02:53.013
<v palpatine>They don't trust you, Anakin.</v>

645
01:02:53.104 --> 01:02:55.811
<v palpatine>They see your future.</v>

646
01:02:55.898 --> 01:03:00.858
<v palpatine>They know your power will be too strong to control.</v>

647
01:03:00.945 --> 01:03:06.736
<v palpatine>You must break through the fog of lies the jedi have created around you.</v>

648
01:03:08.036 --> 01:03:12.154
<v palpatine>Let me help you to know the subtleties of the force.</v>

649
01:03:13.124 --> 01:03:15.035
<v anakin>How do you know the ways of the force?</v>

650
01:03:15.126 --> 01:03:19.836
<v palpatine>My mentor taught me everything about the force.</v>

651
01:03:19.922 --> 01:03:22.914
<v palpatine>Even the nature of the dark side.</v>

652
01:03:24.886 --> 01:03:27.218
<v anakin>You know the dark side?</v>

653
01:03:27.930 --> 01:03:29.761
<v palpatine>Anakin,</v>

654
01:03:29.849 --> 01:03:33.182
<v palpatine>if one is to understand the great mystery,</v>

655
01:03:33.269 --> 01:03:35.851
<v palpatine>one must study all its aspects,</v>

656
01:03:35.938 --> 01:03:38.896
<v palpatine>not just the dogmatic narrow view of the jedi.</v>

657
01:03:38.983 --> 01:03:42.817
<v palpatine>If you wish to become a complete and wise leader,</v>

658
01:03:42.904 --> 01:03:46.567
<v palpatine>you must embrace a larger view of the force.</v>

659
01:03:46.657 --> 01:03:49.273
<v palpatine>Be careful of the jedi, Anakin.</v>

660
01:03:50.036 --> 01:03:51.572
<v palpatine>Only through me</v>

661
01:03:51.662 --> 01:03:55.530
<v palpatine>can you achieve a power greater than any jedi.</v>

662
01:03:55.625 --> 01:03:58.958
<v palpatine>Learn to know the dark side of the force,</v>

663
01:03:59.045 --> 01:04:02.708
<v palpatine>and you will be able to save your wife</v>

664
01:04:02.799 --> 01:04:04.881
<v palpatine>from certain death.</v>

665
01:04:05.968 --> 01:04:07.879
<v anakin>What did you say?</v>

666
01:04:07.970 --> 01:04:11.633
<v palpatine>Use my knowledge. I beg you.</v>

667
01:04:13.309 --> 01:04:15.516
<v anakin>You're the sith lord.</v>

668
01:04:15.603 --> 01:04:19.471
<v palpatine>I know what's been troubling you. Listen to me.</v>

669
01:04:19.565 --> 01:04:24.150
<v palpatine>Don't continue to be a pawn of the jedi council.</v>

670
01:04:26.280 --> 01:04:29.738
<v palpatine>Ever since I've known you, you've been searching for a life</v>

671
01:04:29.826 --> 01:04:32.408
<v palpatine>greater than that of an ordinary jedi.</v>

672
01:04:32.495 --> 01:04:34.907
<v palpatine>A life of significance,</v>

673
01:04:34.997 --> 01:04:37.363
<v palpatine>of conscience.</v>

674
01:04:41.504 --> 01:04:45.793
<v palpatine>Are you going to kill me?</v>
<v anakin>I would certainly like to.</v>

675
01:04:46.843 --> 01:04:49.255
<v palpatine>I know you would.</v>

676
01:04:49.345 --> 01:04:53.179
<v palpatine>I can feel your anger.</v>

677
01:04:53.266 --> 01:04:55.973
<v palpatine>It gives you focus,</v>

678
01:04:56.060 --> 01:04:58.426
<v palpatine>makes you stronger.</v>

679
01:05:04.694 --> 01:05:07.276
<v anakin>I'm going to turn you over to the jedi council.</v>

680
01:05:07.363 --> 01:05:08.819
<v palpatine>Of course. You should.</v>

681
01:05:08.906 --> 01:05:11.943
<v palpatine>But you're not sure of their intentions, are you?</v>

682
01:05:12.034 --> 01:05:15.618
<v anakin>I will quickly discover the truth of all this.</v>

683
01:05:15.705 --> 01:05:18.117
<v palpatine>You have great wisdom, Anakin.</v>

684
01:05:18.207 --> 01:05:21.870
<v palpatine>Know the power of the dark side.</v>

685
01:05:21.961 --> 01:05:24.748
<v palpatine>Power to save Padmé.</v>

686
01:06:53.928 --> 01:06:55.964
Aaah!

687
01:07:32.508 --> 01:07:34.419
<v obi-wan>So uncivilized.</v>

688
01:07:41.934 --> 01:07:43.970
<v anakin>Master windu, I must talk to you.</v>

689
01:07:44.061 --> 01:07:48.145
<v mace-windu>Skywalker, we just received word that Obi-Wan has destroyed general grievous.</v>

690
01:07:48.232 --> 01:07:49.952
<v mace-windu>We're on our way to make sure the chancellor</v>

691
01:07:50.026 --> 01:07:52.187
<v mace-windu>returns emergency power back to the senate.</v>

692
01:07:52.278 --> 01:07:56.021
<v anakin>He won't give up his power. I've just learned a terrible truth.</v>

693
01:07:56.115 --> 01:07:59.232
<v anakin>I think chancellor palpatine is a sith lord.</v>

694
01:07:59.327 --> 01:08:01.283
<v mace-windu>A sith lord?</v>

695
01:08:01.370 --> 01:08:04.237
<v anakin>Yes. The one we've been looking for.</v>

696
01:08:04.332 --> 01:08:05.822
<v mace-windu>How do you know this?</v>

697
01:08:05.916 --> 01:08:08.282
<v anakin>He knows the ways of the force.</v>

698
01:08:08.377 --> 01:08:10.538
<v anakin>He's been trained to use the dark side.</v>

699
01:08:10.630 --> 01:08:13.463
<v mace-windu>Are you sure?</v>
<v anakin>Absolutely.</v>

700
01:08:14.884 --> 01:08:17.125
<v mace-windu>Then our worst fears have been realized.</v>

701
01:08:17.219 --> 01:08:20.711
<v mace-windu>We must move quickly if the jedi order is to survive.</v>

702
01:08:20.806 --> 01:08:23.263
<v anakin>Master, the chancellor is very powerful.</v>

703
01:08:23.351 --> 01:08:25.637
<v anakin>You'll need my help if you're going to arrest him.</v>

704
01:08:25.728 --> 01:08:28.686
<v mace-windu>For your own good, stay out of this affair.</v>

705
01:08:28.773 --> 01:08:31.560
<v mace-windu>I sense a great deal of confusion in you, young Skywalker.</v>

706
01:08:31.651 --> 01:08:33.812
<v mace-windu>There is much fear that clouds your judgment.</v>

707
01:08:33.903 --> 01:08:36.110
<v anakin>I must go, master. =no.</v>

708
01:08:38.074 --> 01:08:40.065
<v mace-windu>If what you've told me is true,</v>

709
01:08:40.159 --> 01:08:42.070
<v mace-windu>you will have gained my trust.</v>

710
01:08:42.161 --> 01:08:44.743
<v mace-windu>But for now, remain here.</v>

711
01:08:45.915 --> 01:08:48.748
<v mace-windu>Wait in the council chambers until we return.</v>

712
01:08:50.086 --> 01:08:52.293
<v anakin>(Click, whirring) Yes, master.</v>

713
01:09:22.034 --> 01:09:24.650
<v palpatine>You do know, don't you,</v>

714
01:09:24.745 --> 01:09:27.111
<v palpatine>if the jedi destroy me,</v>

715
01:09:27.206 --> 01:09:31.199
<v palpatine>any chance of saving her will be lost.</v>

716
01:11:00.090 --> 01:11:04.550
<v palpatine>Master windu. I take it general grievous has been destroyed then.</v>

717
01:11:05.346 --> 01:11:07.928
<v palpatine>I must say you're here sooner than expected.</v>

718
01:11:08.015 --> 01:11:11.633
<v mace-windu>In the name of the galactic senate of the Republic,</v>

719
01:11:11.727 --> 01:11:13.683
<v mace-windu>you're under arrest, chancellor.</v>

720
01:11:13.771 --> 01:11:16.387
<v palpatine>Are you threatening me, master jedi?</v>

721
01:11:16.482 --> 01:11:18.438
<v mace-windu>The senate will decide your fate.</v>

722
01:11:18.526 --> 01:11:22.394
<v palpatine>I am the senate.</v>
<v mace-windu>Not yet.</v>

723
01:11:27.618 --> 01:11:30.075
<v palpatine>It's treason then.</v>

724
01:13:09.178 --> 01:13:12.591
<v mace-windu>You are under arrest, my lord.</v>

725
01:13:13.682 --> 01:13:16.264
<v palpatine>Anakin, I told you it would come to this.</v>

726
01:13:16.352 --> 01:13:18.013
<v palpatine>I was right.</v>

727
01:13:18.103 --> 01:13:20.264
<v palpatine>The jedi are taking over.</v>

728
01:13:20.356 --> 01:13:22.847
<v mace-windu>The oppression of the sith will never return.</v>

729
01:13:22.942 --> 01:13:25.183
<v mace-windu>You have lost.</v>

730
01:13:25.277 --> 01:13:27.268
<v palpatine>No.</v>

731
01:13:27.363 --> 01:13:30.981
<v palpatine>No. No. You will die!</v>

732
01:13:33.035 --> 01:13:35.617
<v palpatine>He's a traitor!</v>

733
01:13:35.704 --> 01:13:39.037
<v mace-windu>He is the traitor! (Groaning)</v>

734
01:13:40.626 --> 01:13:45.245
<v palpatine>I have the power to save the one you love.</v>

735
01:13:45.339 --> 01:13:48.172
<v palpatine>You must choose.</v>

736
01:13:49.218 --> 01:13:51.834
<v mace-windu>Don't listen to him, Anakin!</v>

737
01:13:52.888 --> 01:13:55.550
<v palpatine>Don't let him kill me.</v>

738
01:13:58.644 --> 01:14:01.386
<v palpatine>I can't hold it any longer.</v>

739
01:14:01.480 --> 01:14:04.722
<v palpatine>(Stammering) I can't. I'm weak.</v>

740
01:14:04.817 --> 01:14:06.899
<v palpatine>I'm too weak.</v>

741
01:14:06.986 --> 01:14:08.442
Anakin.

742
01:14:08.529 --> 01:14:11.020
<v palpatine>Help me. Help me!</v>

743
01:14:14.159 --> 01:14:17.697
<v palpatine>I can't hold on any longer.</v>

744
01:14:17.788 --> 01:14:20.951
<v mace-windu>I am going to end this once and for all.</v>

745
01:14:21.041 --> 01:14:22.997
<v anakin>You can't.</v>

746
01:14:23.085 --> 01:14:25.041
<v anakin>He must stand trial.</v>

747
01:14:25.879 --> 01:14:28.541
<v mace-windu>He has control of the senate and the courts.</v>

748
01:14:28.632 --> 01:14:30.873
<v mace-windu>He's too dangerous to be left alive.</v>

749
01:14:30.968 --> 01:14:34.961
<v palpatine>I'm too weak. Oh. Don't kill me. Please.</v>

750
01:14:35.055 --> 01:14:36.966
<v anakin>It's not the jedi way.</v>

751
01:14:37.057 --> 01:14:38.593
<v anakin>He must live.</v>

752
01:14:40.853 --> 01:14:42.844
<v palpatine>Please don't.</v>

753
01:14:42.938 --> 01:14:44.269
<v anakin>I need him.</v>

754
01:14:45.274 --> 01:14:47.560
<v palpatine>Please don't! =nol</v>

755
01:14:53.532 --> 01:14:56.319
<v palpatine>Power!</v>

756
01:15:02.041 --> 01:15:06.660
<v palpatine>Unlimited power!</v>

757
01:15:17.097 --> 01:15:19.634
<v anakin>What have I done?</v>

758
01:15:28.108 --> 01:15:32.147
<v palpatine>You're fulfilling your destiny, Anakin. J</v>

759
01:15:33.864 --> 01:15:35.980
<v palpatine>become my apprentice.</v>

760
01:15:36.075 --> 01:15:41.536
<v palpatine>Learn to use the dark side of the force.</v>

761
01:15:44.166 --> 01:15:47.158
<v anakin>I will do whatever you ask.</v>

762
01:15:49.379 --> 01:15:51.791
<v palpatine>Good.</v>

763
01:15:53.467 --> 01:15:56.083
<v anakin>Just help me save padmeé's life.</v>

764
01:15:58.013 --> 01:16:00.425
<v anakin>I can't live without her:</v>

765
01:16:03.560 --> 01:16:08.475
<v palpatine>To cheat death is a power only one has achieved,</v>

766
01:16:08.565 --> 01:16:12.274
<v palpatine>but if we work together,</v>

767
01:16:12.361 --> 01:16:16.195
<v palpatine>I know we can discover the secret.</v>

768
01:16:17.616 --> 01:16:19.948
<v anakin>I pledge myself</v>

769
01:16:21.328 --> 01:16:24.365
<v anakin>to your teachings.</v>

770
01:16:24.456 --> 01:16:26.492
<v palpatine>Good.</v>

771
01:16:26.583 --> 01:16:29.165
<v palpatine>Good.</v>

772
01:16:37.427 --> 01:16:41.887
<v palpatine>The force is strong with you.</v>

773
01:16:41.974 --> 01:16:47.560
<v palpatine>A powerful sith you will become.</v>

774
01:16:47.646 --> 01:16:51.935
<v palpatine>Henceforth you shall be known as,</v>

775
01:16:52.025 --> 01:16:53.356
<v palpatine>darth</v>

776
01:16:54.736 --> 01:16:56.272
<v palpatine>vader.</v>

777
01:17:00.868 --> 01:17:03.905
<v anakin>Thank you, my master.</v>

778
01:17:06.081 --> 01:17:08.072
<v palpatine>Rise.</v>

779
01:17:21.221 --> 01:17:26.181
<v palpatine>Because the council did not trust you, my young apprentice,</v>

780
01:17:27.728 --> 01:17:32.518
<v palpatine>I believe you are the only jedi with no knowledge of this plot.</v>

781
01:17:33.817 --> 01:17:36.559
<v palpatine>When the jedi learn what has transpired here,</v>

782
01:17:36.653 --> 01:17:38.644
<v palpatine>they will kill us,</v>

783
01:17:38.739 --> 01:17:41.355
<v palpatine>along with all the senators.</v>

784
01:17:41.450 --> 01:17:43.441
<v anakin>I agree.</v>

785
01:17:43.535 --> 01:17:47.153
<v anakin>The council's next move will be against the senate.</v>

786
01:17:47.247 --> 01:17:50.239
<v palpatine>Every single jedi,</v>

787
01:17:50.334 --> 01:17:53.622
<v palpatine>including your friend Obi-Wan Kenobi,</v>

788
01:17:53.712 --> 01:17:57.296
<v palpatine>is now an enemy of the Republic.</v>

789
01:17:58.300 --> 01:18:00.291
<v anakin>I understand, master.</v>

790
01:18:00.385 --> 01:18:03.001
<v palpatine>We must move quickly.</v>

791
01:18:03.096 --> 01:18:05.052
<v palpatine>The jedi are relentless.</v>

792
01:18:05.140 --> 01:18:10.976
<v palpatine>If they are not all destroyed, it will be civil war without end.</v>

793
01:18:12.648 --> 01:18:16.641
<v palpatine>First I want you to go to the jedi temple.</v>

794
01:18:17.527 --> 01:18:20.644
<v palpatine>We will catch them off-balance.</v>

795
01:18:21.365 --> 01:18:24.698
<v palpatine>Do what must be done, lord vader.</v>

796
01:18:24.785 --> 01:18:28.778
<v palpatine>Do not hesitate. Show no mercy.</v>

797
01:18:28.872 --> 01:18:33.662
<v palpatine>Only then will you be strong enough with the dark side</v>

798
01:18:33.752 --> 01:18:36.164
<v palpatine>to save Padmé.</v>

799
01:18:36.880 --> 01:18:40.748
<v anakin>What about the other jedi spread across the galaxy?</v>

800
01:18:40.842 --> 01:18:43.959
<v palpatine>Their betrayal will be dealt with.</v>

801
01:18:45.847 --> 01:18:49.135
<v palpatine>After you have killed all the jedi in the temple,</v>

802
01:18:49.226 --> 01:18:51.933
<v palpatine>go to the mustafar system.</v>

803
01:18:52.020 --> 01:18:55.308
<v palpatine>Wipe out viceroy gunray</v>

804
01:18:55.399 --> 01:18:58.857
<v palpatine>and the other separatist leaders.</v>

805
01:18:58.944 --> 01:19:04.860
<v palpatine>Once more the sith will rule the galaxy!</v>

806
01:19:06.076 --> 01:19:07.987
<v palpatine>And</v>

807
01:19:08.078 --> 01:19:12.868
<v palpatine>we shall have peace.</v>

808
01:19:56.209 --> 01:19:59.042
Sergeant, over here!

809
01:20:04.009 --> 01:20:05.749
All red units, let's move it!

810
01:20:05.844 --> 01:20:07.755
Come on. Let's go!

811
01:20:21.610 --> 01:20:23.646
<v obi-wan>Commander, contact your troops.</v>

812
01:20:23.737 --> 01:20:25.693
<v obi-wan>Tell them to move to the higher levels.</v>

813
01:20:25.781 --> 01:20:27.692
<v cody>Very good, sir.</v>

814
01:20:27.783 --> 01:20:29.944
<v cody>I think you'll be needing this.</v>

815
01:20:30.035 --> 01:20:33.619
<v obi-wan>Thank you, Cody. Now let's get a move on. We've got a battle to win here.</v>

816
01:20:33.705 --> 01:20:35.616
Hyah!
<v cody>Yes, sir.</v>

817
01:20:42.381 --> 01:20:44.463
Commander coady,

818
01:20:44.549 --> 01:20:47.882
<v sidious>the time has come.</v>

819
01:20:47.969 --> 01:20:52.212
<v sidious>Execute order 686.</v>

820
01:20:52.307 --> 01:20:54.298
<v cody>Yes, my lord.</v>

821
01:20:58.772 --> 01:21:00.137
<v cody>Blast him!</v>

822
01:21:27.134 --> 01:21:28.499
Come onl!

823
01:22:18.560 --> 01:22:23.099
<v sidious>Execute order 66,</v>

824
01:22:23.190 --> 01:22:24.851
<v jag>it will be done, my lord.</v>

825
01:23:07.651 --> 01:23:09.937
<v gree>It will be done, my lord.</v>

826
01:23:46.481 --> 01:23:48.893
<v role-youngling>Master Skywalker, there are too many of them.</v>

827
01:23:48.984 --> 01:23:50.975
<v role-youngling>What are we going to do?</v>

828
01:24:01.454 --> 01:24:03.069
<v c-3po>The chancellor's office indicated</v>

829
01:24:03.164 --> 01:24:05.621
<v c-3po>master Anakin returned to the jedi temple.</v>

830
01:24:05.709 --> 01:24:08.826
<v c-3po>Don't worry. I'm sure he'll be all right.</v>

831
01:24:38.033 --> 01:24:41.116
<v organa>What's going on here?</v>
<v role-clone-trooper>There's been a rebellion, sir.</v>

832
01:24:41.202 --> 01:24:43.784
<v role-clone-trooper>Don't worry. The situation is under control.</v>

833
01:24:43.872 --> 01:24:47.160
<v role-clone-trooper>I'm sorry, sir. It's time for you to leave.</v>

834
01:24:48.877 --> 01:24:50.833
<v organa>And so it is.</v>

835
01:24:54.466 --> 01:24:57.173
<v appo>Get him!</v>

836
01:25:07.812 --> 01:25:09.723
Nol

837
01:25:13.318 --> 01:25:15.900
don't worry about him. Let him go.

838
01:25:42.764 --> 01:25:45.722
<v role-clone-trooper>All these wookiees are dead. Move to the east.</v>

839
01:25:45.809 --> 01:25:47.800
<v role-clone-trooper>Yes, sir.</v>

840
01:25:55.402 --> 01:25:57.313
Goodbye, tarfful.

841
01:25:57.404 --> 01:25:59.360
Goodbye, Chewbacca.

842
01:26:01.199 --> 01:26:04.111
<v yoda>Miss you I will.</v>

843
01:26:41.114 --> 01:26:43.400
<v organa>Hopefully we'll be able to intercept a few jedi</v>

844
01:26:43.491 --> 01:26:45.903
<v organa>before they walk into this catastrophe.</v>

845
01:26:51.541 --> 01:26:53.497
<v cody>Did you find Kenobi?</v>

846
01:26:53.585 --> 01:26:55.576
<v role-clone-trooper>Sir, no one could have survived that fall.</v>

847
01:26:55.670 --> 01:26:59.003
<v cody>Start loading your men on the ships.</v>

848
01:26:59.090 --> 01:27:01.877
Move it.

849
01:27:33.875 --> 01:27:35.911
<v obi-wan>Emergency code 913.</v>

850
01:27:36.002 --> 01:27:37.913
<v obi-wan>I have no contact on any frequency.</v>

851
01:27:39.964 --> 01:27:42.080
(Distorted) Master Kenobi.

852
01:27:42.175 --> 01:27:44.166
Repeat. Master Kenobi

853
01:27:44.260 --> 01:27:48.173
<v obi-wan>senator organa. My clone troops turned on me. I need help.</v>

854
01:27:48.264 --> 01:27:50.880
<v organa>We have just rescued master Yoda.</v>

855
01:27:50.975 --> 01:27:53.307
<v organa>It appears this ambush has happened everywhere.</v>

856
01:27:53.394 --> 01:27:55.555
<v organa>We're sending you our coordinates.</v>

857
01:28:02.237 --> 01:28:05.195
<v c-3po>(Beeping) Hush! Not so loud.</v>

858
01:28:05.281 --> 01:28:06.691
<v padme>Are you all right?</v>

859
01:28:06.783 --> 01:28:08.385
<v padme>I heard there was an attack on the jedi temple.</v>

860
01:28:08.409 --> 01:28:10.900
You could see the smoke from here. =I'm fine. I'm fine.

861
01:28:10.995 --> 01:28:13.327
<v anakin>I came to see if you and the baby are safe.</v>

862
01:28:13.414 --> 01:28:14.529
<v padme>What's happening?</v>

863
01:28:14.624 --> 01:28:17.491
<v anakin>The jedi have tried to overthrow the Republic.</v>

864
01:28:17.585 --> 01:28:20.167
<v padme>I can't believe that.</v>

865
01:28:20.255 --> 01:28:24.840
<v anakin>I saw master windu attempt to assassinate the chancellor myself.</v>

866
01:28:24.926 --> 01:28:28.418
<v padme>Oh, Anakin. What are you gonna do?</v>

867
01:28:37.105 --> 01:28:39.312
<v anakin>I will not betray the Republic.</v>

868
01:28:41.276 --> 01:28:43.267
<v anakin>My loyalties lie with the chancellor</v>

869
01:28:44.362 --> 01:28:47.104
<v anakin>and with the senate and with you.</v>

870
01:28:47.198 --> 01:28:49.405
<v padme>What about Obi-Wan?</v>

871
01:28:49.492 --> 01:28:51.733
<v anakin>I don't know.</v>

872
01:28:51.828 --> 01:28:53.944
<v anakin>Many jedi have been killed.</v>

873
01:28:54.038 --> 01:28:57.872
<v anakin>We can only hope that he's remained loyal to the chancellor.</v>

874
01:28:57.959 --> 01:29:00.325
<v padme>Anakin, I'm afraid.</v>

875
01:29:02.255 --> 01:29:05.372
<v anakin>Have faith, my love.</v>

876
01:29:05.466 --> 01:29:07.798
<v anakin>Everything will soon be set right.</v>

877
01:29:07.886 --> 01:29:11.299
<v anakin>The chancellor has given me a very important mission.</v>

878
01:29:11.389 --> 01:29:14.597
<v anakin>The separatists have gathered on the mustafar system.</v>

879
01:29:14.684 --> 01:29:17.221
<v anakin>I'm going there to end this war.</v>

880
01:29:17.312 --> 01:29:19.223
<v anakin>Wait for me until I return.</v>

881
01:29:19.314 --> 01:29:21.726
<v anakin>Things will be different. I promise.</v>

882
01:29:27.530 --> 01:29:29.521
<v anakin>Please, wait for me.</v>

883
01:29:33.578 --> 01:29:36.320
<v c-3po>Well, he is under a lot of stress, r2.</v>

884
01:29:38.541 --> 01:29:40.497
<v c-3po>Take care, my little friend.</v>

885
01:29:44.756 --> 01:29:48.465
<v c-3po>Oh, my lady, is there anything I might do?</v>

886
01:29:48.551 --> 01:29:51.088
<v padme>No, thank you, 3po.</v>

887
01:29:51.179 --> 01:29:55.923
<v c-3po>Oh. I... I feel so helpless.</v>

888
01:30:18.748 --> 01:30:22.115
<v obi-wan>How many other jedi have managed to survive?</v>

889
01:30:22.210 --> 01:30:25.543
<v yoda>Heard from no one have we.</v>

890
01:30:25.630 --> 01:30:28.747
<v organa>I saw thousands of troops attack the jedi temple.</v>

891
01:30:28.841 --> 01:30:30.752
<v organa>That's why I went looking for Yoda.</v>

892
01:30:30.843 --> 01:30:33.425
<v obi-wan>Have we had any contact from the temple?</v>

893
01:30:33.513 --> 01:30:36.380
<v yoda>Received a coded retreat message we have.</v>

894
01:30:36.474 --> 01:30:40.513
<v organa>It requests all jedi to return to the temple.</v>

895
01:30:40.603 --> 01:30:44.061
<v organa>It says the war is over.</v>
<v obi-wan>Well, then we must go back.</v>

896
01:30:44.148 --> 01:30:47.640
<v obi-wan>If there are any stragglers, they will fall into the trap and be killed.</v>

897
01:30:47.735 --> 01:30:52.604
<v yoda>Hmm. Suggest dismantling the coded signal, do you?</v>

898
01:30:52.699 --> 01:30:55.441
<v obi-wan>Yes, master. There is too much at stake.</v>

899
01:30:55.535 --> 01:30:58.117
<v yoda>I agree.</v>

900
01:30:58.204 --> 01:31:01.822
<v yoda>And a little more knowledge might light our way.</v>

901
01:31:22.770 --> 01:31:26.228
<v gunray>The plan has gone as you had promised, my lord.</v>

902
01:31:26.315 --> 01:31:29.102
<v sidious>You have done well, viceroy.</v>

903
01:31:29.193 --> 01:31:35.029
<v sidious>When my new apprentice Darth Vader arrives,</v>

904
01:31:35.116 --> 01:31:38.654
<v sidious>he will take care of you.</v>

905
01:31:50.256 --> 01:31:53.373
<v role-pilot>We're receiving a message from the chancellor's office, sir.</v>

906
01:31:53.468 --> 01:31:55.459
<v organa>Send it through.</v>
<v role-pilot>Yes, sir.</v>

907
01:31:57.180 --> 01:32:01.890
<v amedda>Senator organa, the supreme chancellor requests your presence</v>

908
01:32:01.976 --> 01:32:03.967
<v amedda>at a special session of congress.</v>

909
01:32:04.062 --> 01:32:07.646
<v organa>I will be there.</v>
<v amedda>He'll be expecting you.</v>

910
01:32:10.610 --> 01:32:13.898
Could be a trap. =I don't think so.

911
01:32:13.988 --> 01:32:17.105
<v obi-wan>The chancellor will not be able to control the thousands of star systems</v>

912
01:32:17.200 --> 01:32:19.156
<v obi-wan>without keeping the senate intact.</v>

913
01:32:20.078 --> 01:32:23.286
<v yoda>If a special session of congress there is,</v>

914
01:32:23.372 --> 01:32:27.035
<v yoda>easier for us to enter the jedi temple it will be.</v>

915
01:33:05.164 --> 01:33:07.155
<v anakin>R2, stay with the ship.</v>

916
01:33:31.858 --> 01:33:35.601
<v gunray>Welcome, lord vader. We've been expecting you.</v>

917
01:34:07.435 --> 01:34:11.974
<v palpatine>And the jedi rebellion has been foiled.</v>

918
01:34:12.064 --> 01:34:13.224
<v organa>What's happened?</v>

919
01:34:13.316 --> 01:34:14.418
<v padme>The chancellor's been elaborating</v>

920
01:34:14.442 --> 01:34:17.775
<v padme>on a plot by the jedi to overthrow the senate.</v>

921
01:34:17.862 --> 01:34:23.357
<v palpatine>The remaining jedi will be hunted down and defeated.</v>

922
01:34:39.133 --> 01:34:41.624
<v obi-wan>Not even the younglings survived.</v>

923
01:34:42.720 --> 01:34:44.676
<v yoda>Killed not by clones</v>

924
01:34:44.764 --> 01:34:48.006
<v yoda>this padawan.</v>

925
01:34:49.101 --> 01:34:51.763
<v yoda>By a lightsaber he was.</v>

926
01:34:58.611 --> 01:35:02.195
<v obi-wan>Who? Who could have done this?</v>

927
01:35:12.875 --> 01:35:16.083
<v palpatine>The attempt on my life</v>

928
01:35:16.170 --> 01:35:18.832
<v palpatine>has left me scarred</v>

929
01:35:18.923 --> 01:35:21.915
<v palpatine>and deformed.</v>

930
01:35:22.009 --> 01:35:24.921
<v palpatine>But I assure you.</v>

931
01:35:25.012 --> 01:35:29.756
<v palpatine>My resolve has never been stronger!</v>

932
01:35:33.938 --> 01:35:36.145
<v rune-haako>Stop! No!</v>

933
01:35:47.451 --> 01:35:51.114
<v palpatine>In order to ensure the security</v>

934
01:35:51.205 --> 01:35:53.787
<v palpatine>and continuing stability,</v>

935
01:35:53.874 --> 01:35:57.787
<v palpatine>the Republic will be reorganized</v>

936
01:35:57.878 --> 01:36:03.339
<v palpatine>into the first galactic empire!</v>

937
01:36:03.426 --> 01:36:05.462
<v palpatine>For a safe</v>

938
01:36:05.553 --> 01:36:10.138
<v palpatine>and secure society.</v>

939
01:36:19.525 --> 01:36:22.232
<v padme>So this is how Liberty dies.</v>

940
01:36:22.320 --> 01:36:25.062
<v padme>With thunderous applause.</v>

941
01:36:27.450 --> 01:36:29.657
<v gunray>The war is over.</v>

942
01:36:29.744 --> 01:36:33.862
<v gunray>Lord Sidious promised us peace. We only want...</v>

943
01:36:42.006 --> 01:36:46.716
<v obi-wan>I have recalibrated the code, warning all surviving jedi to stay away.</v>

944
01:36:46.802 --> 01:36:49.259
<v yoda>For the clones</v>

945
01:36:49.347 --> 01:36:53.465
<v yoda>to discover the recalibration a long time it will take.</v>

946
01:37:05.780 --> 01:37:07.862
<v obi-wan>Wait. Master:</v>

947
01:37:08.699 --> 01:37:11.156
<v obi-wan>There is something I must know.</v>

948
01:37:17.249 --> 01:37:19.706
<v yoda>If into the security recordings you go,</v>

949
01:37:19.794 --> 01:37:21.705
<v yoda>only pain will you find.</v>

950
01:37:21.796 --> 01:37:25.288
<v obi-wan>I must know the truth, master.</v>

951
01:37:32.139 --> 01:37:34.095
<v obi-wan>It can't be.</v>

952
01:37:34.183 --> 01:37:36.094
<v obi-wan>It can't be.</v>

953
01:37:36.185 --> 01:37:40.269
<v sidious>You have done well, my new apprentice.</v>

954
01:37:40.356 --> 01:37:43.393
<v sidious>Now, lord vader</v>

955
01:37:43.484 --> 01:37:47.022
<v sidious>go and bring peace to the empire.</v>

956
01:37:47.113 --> 01:37:49.274
<v obi-wan>I can't watch any more.</v>

957
01:37:49.365 --> 01:37:53.984
<v yoda>Destroy the sith we must.</v>

958
01:37:55.746 --> 01:37:57.862
<v obi-wan>Send me to kill the emperor.</v>

959
01:37:57.957 --> 01:38:00.243
<v obi-wan>I will not kill Anakin.</v>

960
01:38:00.334 --> 01:38:05.078
<v yoda>To fight this lord Sidious, strong enough you are not.</v>

961
01:38:05.172 --> 01:38:08.414
<v obi-wan>He is like my brother. I cannot do it.</v>

962
01:38:08.509 --> 01:38:14.254
<v yoda>Twisted by the dark side young Skywalker has become.</v>

963
01:38:14.348 --> 01:38:17.761
<v yoda>The boy you trained, gone he is.</v>

964
01:38:17.852 --> 01:38:20.764
<v yoda>Consumed by Darth Vader.</v>

965
01:38:20.855 --> 01:38:23.892
<v obi-wan>I do not know where the emperor has sent him.</v>

966
01:38:23.983 --> 01:38:26.224
<v obi-wan>I don't know where to look.</v>

967
01:38:27.528 --> 01:38:31.237
<v yoda>Use your feelings, Obi-Wan, and find him you will,</v>

968
01:38:41.750 --> 01:38:44.366
<v obi-wan>When was the last time you saw him?</v>

969
01:38:44.462 --> 01:38:45.872
<v padme>Yesterday.</v>

970
01:38:45.963 --> 01:38:47.874
<v obi-wan>And do you know where he is now?</v>

971
01:38:48.924 --> 01:38:50.915
<v padme>No.</v>

972
01:38:51.010 --> 01:38:54.628
<v obi-wan>Padme, I need your help.</v>

973
01:38:54.722 --> 01:38:57.714
<v obi-wan>He is in grave danger.</v>
<v padme>From the sith?</v>

974
01:38:57.808 --> 01:38:59.799
<v obi-wan>From himself</v>

975
01:39:02.229 --> 01:39:04.311
<v obi-wan>padme,</v>

976
01:39:04.398 --> 01:39:06.810
<v obi-wan>Anakin has turned to the dark side.</v>

977
01:39:06.901 --> 01:39:10.393
<v padme>You're wrong. How could you even say that?</v>

978
01:39:13.157 --> 01:39:16.991
<v obi-wan>I have seen a security hologram</v>

979
01:39:17.077 --> 01:39:19.534
<v obi-wan>of him</v>

980
01:39:19.622 --> 01:39:21.533
<v obi-wan>killing younglings.</v>

981
01:39:21.624 --> 01:39:24.661
<v padme>Not Anakin. He couldn't.</v>

982
01:39:24.752 --> 01:39:27.744
<v obi-wan>He was deceived by a lie. We all were.</v>

983
01:39:27.838 --> 01:39:32.377
<v obi-wan>It appears that the chancellor is behind everything, including the war.</v>

984
01:39:34.178 --> 01:39:36.920
<v obi-wan>Palpatine is the sith lord we've been looking for.</v>

985
01:39:37.014 --> 01:39:41.132
<v obi-wan>After the death of count dooku, Anakin became his new apprentice.</v>

986
01:39:47.316 --> 01:39:49.307
<v padme>I don't believe you.</v>

987
01:39:50.694 --> 01:39:52.685
<v padme>I can't.</v>

988
01:39:57.785 --> 01:39:58.945
<v obi-wan>Padme,</v>

989
01:40:00.371 --> 01:40:02.657
<v obi-wan>I must find him.</v>

990
01:40:05.125 --> 01:40:07.116
<v padme>You're going to kill him, aren't you? Going y</v>

991
01:40:10.798 --> 01:40:13.289
<v obi-wan>he has become a very great threat.</v>

992
01:40:15.886 --> 01:40:17.877
<v padme>I can't.</v>

993
01:40:31.068 --> 01:40:33.024
<v obi-wan>Anakin is the father, isn't he?</v>

994
01:40:37.491 --> 01:40:38.981
<v obi-wan>I'm so sorry.</v>

995
01:41:25.331 --> 01:41:26.766
<v typho>Milady, let me come with you.</v>

996
01:41:26.790 --> 01:41:29.748
<v padme>There's no danger. The fighting's over. And this is personal.</v>

997
01:41:29.835 --> 01:41:32.247
<v typho>As you wish, milady, but I strongly disagree.</v>

998
01:41:32.338 --> 01:41:36.001
<v padme>I'll be all right, captain. This is something I must do myself.</v>

999
01:41:36.091 --> 01:41:38.503
<v padme>Besides, 3po will look after me.</v>

1000
01:41:40.346 --> 01:41:42.337
<v c-3po>Oh, dear.</v>

1001
01:41:52.941 --> 01:41:55.057
<v c-3po>Do you know?</v>

1002
01:41:55.152 --> 01:41:58.770
<v c-3po>I think I'm beginning to get the hang of this flying business. Hmm,</v>

1003
01:42:26.141 --> 01:42:29.599
<v vader>The separatists have been taken care of, my master.</v>

1004
01:42:29.687 --> 01:42:32.599
<v sidious>It is finished then.</v>

1005
01:42:33.982 --> 01:42:39.818
<v sidious>You have restored peace and justice to the galaxy.</v>

1006
01:42:39.905 --> 01:42:44.820
<v sidious>Send a message to the ships of the trade federation.</v>

1007
01:42:44.910 --> 01:42:50.075
<v sidious>All droid units must shut down immediately.</v>

1008
01:42:50.165 --> 01:42:52.281
<v vader>Very good, my lord.</v>

1009
01:43:52.186 --> 01:43:54.302
<v anakin>I saw your ship.</v>

1010
01:43:57.107 --> 01:44:00.144
<v anakin>What are you doing out here?</v>
<v padme>I was so worried about you.</v>

1011
01:44:01.570 --> 01:44:04.437
<v padme>Obi-Wan told me terrible things.</v>

1012
01:44:04.531 --> 01:44:06.692
<v anakin>What things?</v>

1013
01:44:06.784 --> 01:44:09.742
<v padme>He said you've turned to the dark side.</v>

1014
01:44:09.828 --> 01:44:12.240
<v padme>That you</v>

1015
01:44:12.331 --> 01:44:14.492
<v padme>killed younglings.</v>

1016
01:44:16.001 --> 01:44:18.708
<v anakin>Obi-Wan is trying to turn you against me.</v>

1017
01:44:18.796 --> 01:44:22.584
<v padme>He cares about us. Js?</v>

1018
01:44:22.674 --> 01:44:25.416
<v padme>He knows.</v>

1019
01:44:25.511 --> 01:44:27.422
<v padme>He wants to help you.</v>

1020
01:44:31.391 --> 01:44:34.508
<v padme>Anakin, all I want is your love.</v>

1021
01:44:34.603 --> 01:44:36.969
<v anakin>Love won't save you, padme.</v>

1022
01:44:37.064 --> 01:44:40.306
Only my new powers can do that. At what cost?

1023
01:44:40.400 --> 01:44:42.812
<v padme>You're a good person. Don't do this.</v>

1024
01:44:42.903 --> 01:44:45.645
<v anakin>I won't lose you the way I lost my mother.</v>

1025
01:44:45.739 --> 01:44:49.982
<v anakin>I am becoming more powerful than any jedi has ever dreamed of.</v>

1026
01:44:50.077 --> 01:44:52.910
<v anakin>And I'm doing it for you. To protect you.</v>

1027
01:44:54.706 --> 01:44:56.162
<v padme>Come away with me.</v>

1028
01:44:56.250 --> 01:44:58.957
<v padme>Help me raise our child.</v>

1029
01:44:59.044 --> 01:45:01.831
<v padme>Leave everything else behind while we still can.</v>

1030
01:45:01.922 --> 01:45:03.287
<v anakin>Don't you see?</v>

1031
01:45:03.382 --> 01:45:06.624
<v anakin>We don't have to run away anymore.</v>

1032
01:45:06.718 --> 01:45:09.255
<v anakin>I have brought peace to the Republic.</v>

1033
01:45:09.346 --> 01:45:12.213
<v anakin>I am more powerful than the chancellor.</v>

1034
01:45:12.307 --> 01:45:14.423
<v anakin>I can overthrow him.</v>

1035
01:45:16.478 --> 01:45:19.561
<v anakin>And together, you and I can rule the galaxy,</v>

1036
01:45:19.648 --> 01:45:22.105
<v anakin>make things the way we want them to be.</v>

1037
01:45:28.407 --> 01:45:30.443
<v padme>I don't believe what I'm hearing.</v>

1038
01:45:31.910 --> 01:45:35.243
<v padme>Obi-Wan was right. You've changed.</v>

1039
01:45:37.416 --> 01:45:40.283
<v anakin>I don't want to hear any more about Obi-Wan.</v>

1040
01:45:40.377 --> 01:45:44.586
<v anakin>The jedi turned against me. Don't you turn against me.</v>

1041
01:45:46.258 --> 01:45:48.294
